msgctxt "68_Isawa"
msgid "All right. You listen, and you listen good. Fay's <Italic>my</Italic> girl.\\r\nOnly I know how to treat her like the lady she is. But you?\\r\nCompared to me, you're jack shit－and about to be dead meat!"
msgstr "De acuerdo. Escúchame bien. Fay es <Italic>mi</Italic> chica. Solo yo se\\r\ntratarla como se merece. ¿Y tú? Comparado a mi eres\\r \nuna mierda－¡una mierda con las horas contadas!"

